{"sounds":{"intro":"Māori has five vowels (a, e, i, o, u) and ten consonants (h, k, m, n, ng, p, r, t, w, wh). Every vowel is said, and a bar over a vowel (macron: ā, ē, ī, ō, ū) makes it about twice as long. The macron changes the meaning, so it matters.","rows":[["a","ah, like \"far\"","tahi"],["e","eh, like \"bed\"","rewera"],["i","ee, like \"see\"","rima"],["o","oh, like \"more\"","ono"],["u","oo, like \"food\"","tūru"],["ā ē ī ō ū","the same vowel, held about twice as long","whā"],["wh","most speakers say \"f\"; some say a soft \"w\"","whare"],["ng","like \"ng\" in \"singer\", never \"g\" as in \"finger\"","ngeru"],["r","a quick tap of the tongue, between \"r\" and \"d\"","rua"]],"notes":["Words get stress on the first long vowel, or the first syllable if there is none. There are no consonant clusters, so every syllable ends in a vowel.","Māori sentences begin with the verb marker. \"Kei te\" shows something happening now: \"Kei te kai ahau\" (I am eating). The pool is unreviewed and a few rare words are best guesses."]},"numbers":[{"id":"0-to-10","title":"0 to 10","items":[["zero","kore","KOH-reh"],["one","tahi","TAH-hee"],["two","rua","ROO-ah"],["three","toru","TOH-roo"],["four","whā","FAH"],["five","rima","REE-mah"],["six","ono","OH-noh"],["seven","whitu","FEE-too"],["eight","waru","WAH-roo"],["nine","iwa","EE-wah"],["ten","tekau","TEH-kow"]]},{"id":"11-to-20","title":"11 to 20","items":[["eleven","tekau mā tahi","TEH-kow mah TAH-hee"],["twelve","tekau mā rua","TEH-kow mah ROO-ah"],["thirteen","tekau mā toru","TEH-kow mah TOH-roo"],["fourteen","tekau mā whā","TEH-kow mah FAH"],["fifteen","tekau mā rima","TEH-kow mah REE-mah"],["sixteen","tekau mā ono","TEH-kow mah OH-noh"],["seventeen","tekau mā whitu","TEH-kow mah FEE-too"],["eighteen","tekau mā waru","TEH-kow mah WAH-roo"],["nineteen","tekau mā iwa","TEH-kow mah EE-wah"],["twenty","rua tekau","ROO-ah TEH-kow"]]},{"id":"tens-and-big-numbers","title":"Tens and big numbers","items":[["twenty-one","rua tekau mā tahi","ROO-ah TEH-kow mah TAH-hee"],["thirty","toru tekau","TOH-roo TEH-kow"],["forty","whā tekau","FAH TEH-kow"],["fifty","rima tekau","REE-mah TEH-kow"],["sixty","ono tekau","OH-noh TEH-kow"],["seventy","whitu tekau","FEE-too TEH-kow"],["eighty","waru tekau","WAH-roo TEH-kow"],["ninety","iwa tekau","EE-wah TEH-kow"],["one hundred","kotahi rau","KOH-tah-hee ROW"],["two hundred","e rua rau","eh ROO-ah ROW"],["one thousand","kotahi mano","KOH-tah-hee MAH-noh"],["two thousand","e rua mano","eh ROO-ah MAH-noh"],["ten thousand","kotahi tekau mano","KOH-tah-hee TEH-kow MAH-noh"],["one hundred thousand","kotahi rau mano","KOH-tah-hee ROW MAH-noh"],["one million","kotahi miriona","KOH-tah-hee mee-ree-OH-nah"],["one billion","kotahi piriona","KOH-tah-hee pee-ree-OH-nah"]]},{"id":"order-and-amounts","title":"Order and amounts","items":[["first","tuatahi","too-ah-TAH-hee"],["second","tuarua","too-ah-ROO-ah"],["third","tuatoru","too-ah-TOH-roo"],["half","haurua","how-ROO-ah"],["a few","ētahi","EH-tah-hee"],["many","maha","MAH-hah"],["a pair","he takirua","heh tah-kee-ROO-ah"],["how many?","e hia?","eh HEE-ah"]]}],"greetings":[{"id":"hello-and-goodbye","title":"Hello and goodbye","items":[["hello","kia ora","KEE-ah OH-rah"],["hello (formal, with respect)","tēnā koe","TEH-nah KWAY"],["reply to the formal hello","tēnā koe hoki","TEH-nah KWAY HOH-kee"],["good morning","mōrena","MOH-reh-nah"],["good day","kia pai tō rā","KEE-ah pie toh RAH"],["good evening","ahiahi pai","ah-hee-AH-hee pie"],["good night","pō mārie","poh MAH-ree-eh"],["goodbye","haere rā","HIGH-reh RAH"],["see you later","ka kite anō","kah KEE-teh AH-noh"],["see you tomorrow","ka kite āpōpō","kah KEE-teh ah-poh-POH"]]},{"id":"meeting-people","title":"Meeting people","items":[["how are you? (informal)","kei te pēhea koe?","kay teh PEH-heh-ah KWAY"],["how are you? (formal)","kei te pēhea koe, e te rangatira?","kay teh PEH-heh-ah KWAY, eh teh rah-ngah-TEE-rah"],["I am fine, thanks","kei te pai, tēnā koe","kay teh pie, TEH-nah KWAY"],["and you?","ā, koe?","ah, KWAY"],["not bad","kāore i te kino","KAH-oh-reh ee teh KEE-noh"],["what is your name? (informal)","ko wai tō ingoa?","koh WHY toh ee-NGOH-ah"],["what is your name? (formal)","ko wai tōu ingoa, e te rangatira?","koh WHY toh ee-NGOH-ah, eh teh rah-ngah-TEE-rah"],["my name is...","ko ... tōku ingoa","koh ... TOH-koo ee-NGOH-ah"],["nice to meet you","he pai te tūtaki ki a koe","heh pie teh TOO-tah-kee kee ah KWAY"],["where are you from? (informal)","nō hea koe?","noh HEH-ah KWAY"],["where are you from? (formal)","nō hea koe, e te rangatira?","noh HEH-ah KWAY, eh teh rah-ngah-TEE-rah"],["I am from England","nō Ingarangi ahau","noh ee-ngah-RAH-ngee AH-how"]]},{"id":"politeness","title":"Politeness","items":[["please","tēnā koa","TEH-nah KOH-ah"],["thank you","ngā mihi","ngah MEE-hee"],["thank you very much","ngā mihi nui","ngah MEE-hee NOO-ee"],["you are welcome","kāore he aha","KAH-oh-reh heh AH-hah"],["excuse me","aroha mai","ah-ROH-hah MY"],["sorry","e pōuri ana ahau","eh POH-oo-ree AH-nah AH-how"],["yes","āe","AH-eh"],["no","kao","KOW"],["congratulations","ka rawe","kah RAH-weh"],["good luck","kia kaha","KEE-ah KAH-hah"],["happy birthday","hari huritau","HAH-ree HOO-ree-tow"],["cheers","kia ora!","KEE-ah OH-rah"]]}],"phrases":[{"id":"essential-phrases","title":"Essential phrases","items":[["hello","kia ora","KEE-ah OH-rah"],["goodbye","haere rā","HIGH-reh RAH"],["please","tēnā koa","TEH-nah KOH-ah"],["thank you","ngā mihi","ngah MEE-hee"],["you are welcome","kāore he aha","KAH-oh-reh heh AH-hah"],["yes","āe","AH-eh"],["no","kao","KOW"],["excuse me","aroha mai","ah-ROH-hah MY"],["sorry","e pōuri ana ahau","eh POH-oo-ree AH-nah AH-how"],["I do not understand","kāore au e mārama","KAH-oh-reh OW eh MAH-rah-mah"],["do you speak English?","kei te kōrero Ingarihi koe?","kay teh KOH-reh-roh ee-ngah-REE-hee KWAY"],["speak slowly, please","kōrero marie, tēnā koa","KOH-reh-roh MAH-ree-eh, TEH-nah KOH-ah"],["can you help me?","ka taea e koe te āwhina i ahau?","kah TIE-ah eh KWAY teh AH-fee-nah ee AH-how"],["where is the toilet?","kei hea te wharepaku?","kay HEH-ah teh fah-reh-PAH-koo"],["how much is it?","e hia te utu?","eh HEE-ah teh OO-too"],["I would like...","e hiahia ana ahau ki te...","eh hee-AH-hee-ah AH-nah AH-how kee teh"],["I need...","me whai ahau i...","meh FIE AH-how ee"],["my name is...","ko ... tōku ingoa","koh ... TOH-koo ee-NGOH-ah"],["I am lost","kua ngaro ahau","KOO-ah NGAH-roh AH-how"],["what is this?","he aha tēnei?","heh AH-hah TEH-nay"],["I do not know","kāore au e mōhio","KAH-oh-reh OW eh MOH-hee-oh"],["that is OK","kei te pai tērā","kay teh pie TEH-rah"]]},{"id":"formal-and-informal","title":"Formal and informal","items":[["how are you? (informal)","kei te pēhea koe?","kay teh PEH-heh-ah KWAY"],["how are you? (formal)","kei te pēhea koe, e te rangatira?","kay teh PEH-heh-ah KWAY, eh teh rah-ngah-TEE-rah"],["what is your name? (informal)","ko wai tō ingoa?","koh WHY toh ee-NGOH-ah"],["what is your name? (formal)","ko wai tōu ingoa, e te rangatira?","koh WHY toh ee-NGOH-ah, eh teh rah-ngah-TEE-rah"],["do you speak English? (informal)","kei te kōrero Ingarihi koe?","kay teh KOH-reh-roh ee-ngah-REE-hee KWAY"],["do you speak English? (formal)","kei te kōrero Ingarihi koe, e te rangatira?","kay teh KOH-reh-roh ee-ngah-REE-hee KWAY, eh teh rah-ngah-TEE-rah"],["where are you from? (informal)","nō hea koe?","noh HEH-ah KWAY"],["where are you from? (formal)","nō hea koe, e te rangatira?","noh HEH-ah KWAY, eh teh rah-ngah-TEE-rah"],["can you help me? (informal)","ka taea e koe te āwhina i ahau?","kah TIE-ah eh KWAY teh AH-fee-nah ee AH-how"],["can you help me? (formal)","ka taea e koe te āwhina i ahau, e te rangatira?","kah TIE-ah eh KWAY teh AH-fee-nah ee AH-how, eh teh rah-ngah-TEE-rah"],["hi (informal)","kia ora","KEE-ah OH-rah"],["hello (formal)","tēnā koe","TEH-nah KWAY"],["bye (informal)","ka kite","kah KEE-teh"],["goodbye (formal)","haere rā","HIGH-reh RAH"]]},{"id":"survival","title":"Survival","items":[["I understand","kei te mārama ahau","kay teh MAH-rah-mah AH-how"],["I speak a little Māori","kei te kōrero paku ahau i te reo Māori","kay teh KOH-reh-roh PAH-koo AH-how ee teh REH-oh MAH-oh-ree"],["please repeat","tēnā koa, kōrero anō","TEH-nah KOH-ah, KOH-reh-roh AH-noh"],["what does... mean?","he aha te tikanga o...?","heh AH-hah teh tee-KAH-ngah oh"],["how do you say... in Māori?","me pēhea e kī ai... i te reo Māori?","meh PEH-heh-ah eh KEE eye ... ee teh REH-oh MAH-oh-ree"],["please write it down","tēnā koa, tuhia","TEH-nah KOH-ah, TOO-hee-ah"],["help!","āwhina mai!","AH-fee-nah MY"],["I need help","kei te hiahia āwhina ahau","kay teh hee-AH-hee-ah AH-fee-nah AH-how"]]},{"id":"getting-around","title":"Getting around","items":[["where is...?","kei hea...?","kay HEH-ah"],["where is the station?","kei hea te teihana?","kay HEH-ah teh TAY-hah-nah"],["turn left","huri ki mauī","HOO-ree kee MAH-oo-ee"],["turn right","huri ki matau","HOO-ree kee MAH-tow"],["straight ahead","haere tika","HIGH-reh TEE-kah"],["near","e tata ana","eh TAH-tah AH-nah"],["far","tawhiti","TAH-fee-tee"],["how far is it?","e hia te tawhiti?","eh HEE-ah teh TAH-fee-tee"],["a ticket to Samarkand, please","he tīkiti ki Samarkand, tēnā koa","heh TEE-kee-tee kee sah-mar-KAND, TEH-nah KOH-ah"],["what time does the train leave?","ā te hia karaka te wehe ai te tereina?","ah teh HEE-ah KAH-rah-kah teh WEH-heh eye teh TEH-reh-ee-nah"],["to the airport, please","ki te taunga rererangi, tēnā koa","kee teh TOW-ngah REH-reh-rah-ngee, TEH-nah KOH-ah"],["stop here, please","kati i konei, tēnā koa","KAH-tee ee KOH-nay, TEH-nah KOH-ah"]]},{"id":"eating-out","title":"Eating out","items":[["a table for two, please","he tēpu mō tokorua, tēnā koa","heh TEH-poo moh toh-koh-ROO-ah, TEH-nah KOH-ah"],["the menu, please","te rārangi kai, tēnā koa","teh RAH-rah-ngee kie, TEH-nah KOH-ah"],["I will have this","ka tango ahau i tēnei","kah TAH-ngoh AH-how ee TEH-nay"],["water, please","he wai, tēnā koa","heh WHY, TEH-nah KOH-ah"],["the bill, please","te pire, tēnā koa","teh PEE-reh, TEH-nah KOH-ah"],["it is delicious","he reka","heh REH-kah"],["I am hungry","kei te hiakai ahau","kay teh hee-AH-kie AH-how"],["I am thirsty","kei te hiainu ahau","kay teh hee-AH-ee-noo AH-how"],["I am vegetarian","kāore au e kai kiko","KAH-oh-reh OW eh kie KEE-koh"],["I am allergic to nuts","kua pāwera ahau ki ngā nati","KOO-ah PAH-weh-rah AH-how kee ngah NAH-tee"],["no meat, please","kaua he kiko, tēnā koa","KOW-ah heh KEE-koh, TEH-nah KOH-ah"],["another one, please","tētahi atu, tēnā koa","TEH-tah-hee AH-too, TEH-nah KOH-ah"]]},{"id":"shopping","title":"Shopping","items":[["how much is this?","e hia tēnei?","eh HEE-ah TEH-nay"],["it is too expensive","he nui rawa te utu","heh NOO-ee RAH-wah teh OO-too"],["do you have a smaller size?","he rahi iti ake tāu?","heh RAH-hee EE-tee AH-keh TAH-oo"],["I am just looking","e titiro noa ana ahau","eh TEE-tee-roh NOH-ah AH-nah AH-how"],["I will take it","ka tango ahau","kah TAH-ngoh AH-how"],["can I pay by card?","ka taea te utu mā te kāri?","kah TIE-ah teh OO-too mah teh KAH-ree"],["cash","moni","MOH-nee"],["a bag, please","he pēke, tēnā koa","heh PEH-keh, TEH-nah KOH-ah"],["open","tuwhera","TOO-feh-rah"],["closed","kati","KAH-tee"]]},{"id":"hotel-and-travel","title":"Hotel and travel","items":[["I have a reservation","he rahui taku","heh RAH-hoo-ee TAH-koo"],["a room for one night","he rūma mō tētahi pō","heh ROO-mah moh TEH-tah-hee POH"],["what time is breakfast?","ā te hia karaka te parakuihi?","ah teh HEE-ah KAH-rah-kah teh pah-rah-KOO-ee-hee"],["the key, please","te kī, tēnā koa","teh KEE, TEH-nah KOH-ah"],["is there wifi?","he wifi kei konei?","heh WEE-fee kay KOH-nay"],["my passport","taku uruwhenua","TAH-koo oo-roo-FEH-noo-ah"],["my luggage","aku kete haerenga","AH-koo KEH-teh high-REH-ngah"],["I would like to change money","e hiahia ana ahau ki te whakawhiti moni","eh hee-AH-hee-ah AH-nah AH-how kee teh fah-kah-FEE-tee MOH-nee"]]},{"id":"health-and-emergency","title":"Health and emergency","items":[["I feel sick","kei te māuiui ahau","kay teh MAH-oo-ee-oo-ee AH-how"],["I need a doctor","me kite ahau i te taote","meh KEE-teh AH-how ee teh TAH-oh-teh"],["call an ambulance","waea atu ki te waka tūroro","WAH-eh-ah AH-too kee teh WAH-kah TOO-roh-roh"],["it hurts here","he mamae i konei","heh MAH-my ee KOH-nay"],["I have a headache","he mamae taku māhunga","heh MAH-my TAH-koo MAH-hoo-ngah"],["I have a fever","he wera taku tinana","heh WEH-rah TAH-koo TEE-nah-nah"],["where is the pharmacy?","kei hea te toa rongoā?","kay HEH-ah teh TOH-ah ROH-ngoh-ah"],["call the police","waea atu ki ngā pirihimana","WAH-eh-ah AH-too kee ngah pee-ree-hee-MAH-nah"],["my phone was stolen","kua tāhaetia taku waea","KOO-ah TAH-high-eh-tee-ah TAH-koo WAH-eh-ah"]]},{"id":"chatting","title":"Chatting","items":[["what do you do?","he aha tāu mahi?","heh AH-hah TAH-oo MAH-hee"],["I am a student","he akonga ahau","heh ah-KOH-ngah AH-how"],["I am a teacher","he kaiako ahau","heh kie-AH-koh AH-how"],["I live in Tashkent","e noho ana ahau i Tashkent","eh NOH-hoh AH-nah AH-how ee tash-KENT"],["how old are you?","e hia ō tau?","eh HEE-ah oh TOW"],["I am sixteen","e tekau mā ono ōku tau","eh TEH-kow mah OH-noh OH-koo TOW"],["do you like football?","he pai ki a koe te whutupaoro?","heh pie kee ah KWAY teh foo-too-PAH-oh-roh"],["I like music","he pai ki ahau te puoro","heh pie kee AH-how teh poo-OH-roh"],["I love it","kei te aroha ahau ki tēnei","kay teh ah-ROH-hah AH-how kee TEH-nay"],["what time is it?","ko te hia karaka inaianei?","koh teh HEE-ah KAH-rah-kah ee-nie-AH-nay"],["it is three o'clock","ko te toru karaka","koh teh TOH-roo KAH-rah-kah"]]},{"id":"useful-words","title":"Useful words","items":[["and","me","meh"],["but","engari","eh-NGAH-ree"],["because","nā te mea","nah teh MEH-ah"],["very","tino","TEE-noh"],["here","i konei","ee KOH-nay"],["there","i reira","ee RAY-rah"],["now","inaianei","ee-nie-AH-nay"],["today","i tēn